# exp reduction: x = (512·E + j)·ln2/512 + r. INVLN2N = 512/ln 2 rounded; ln2/512 = L1 + L2 + L3 + L4
# (L1 at 33 bits, so K·L1 is exact for |K| < 2^20). P3 … P5: 1/6, 1/24, 1/120, the fast path's
# Taylor coefficients (1/2 is exact).
